WEBVTT

01:50.070 --> 01:53.920
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.380 --> 01:56.750
[Episode 23]

01:57.590 --> 01:59.259
That's all I know.

02:05.150 --> 02:06.680
Have you ever met that girl?

02:06.820 --> 02:08.630
Who exactly is she?

02:10.080 --> 02:12.630
She was Xiao's neighbor back then.

02:13.080 --> 02:14.410
How would I have met her?

02:15.280 --> 02:16.010
But you know,

02:16.280 --> 02:17.710
anyone who could be neighbors
with the Pei family

02:17.710 --> 02:19.840
must have come from a well-off family.

02:20.590 --> 02:22.150
I heard from Xiao's mother

02:22.320 --> 02:24.120
that they went to the same school before.

02:24.120 --> 02:25.250
They got along well.

02:25.800 --> 02:27.079
You don't know this,

02:27.310 --> 02:29.000
but when Xiao was in America,

02:29.310 --> 02:30.920
his temper was even worse than it is now.

02:30.920 --> 02:33.650
So that girl must have
a pretty good personality.

02:35.430 --> 02:36.240
But no matter how good her personality is,

02:36.240 --> 02:37.750
she can't be as...

02:38.420 --> 02:39.950
approachable as our Hu Xiu.

02:41.750 --> 02:44.010
Was your Chinese taught by a gym teacher?

02:44.680 --> 02:46.610
My Chinese is indeed not very good.

02:48.370 --> 02:49.900
I haven't even drunk it yet.

02:50.120 --> 02:51.520
No wonder you're single.

02:56.680 --> 02:57.190
You two

02:57.430 --> 02:59.150
are already together now.

02:59.150 --> 03:00.390
It's already set in stone.

03:00.390 --> 03:02.070
No matter how his mom tries to
set them up, it's useless,

03:02.070 --> 03:02.630
right?

03:03.560 --> 03:04.840
I've added an extra espresso shot for you.

03:04.840 --> 03:06.300
Sober up before you speak.

03:06.430 --> 03:07.630
I am perfectly sober.

03:07.780 --> 03:09.440
And I'm not talking nonsense.

03:10.150 --> 03:11.520
When he was in school,

03:11.520 --> 03:12.750
he never listened to his mom.

03:12.750 --> 03:14.220
So there's even less to worry about now,

03:14.220 --> 03:14.690
right?

03:16.590 --> 03:17.450
How about this?

03:17.590 --> 03:18.840
If you're really that uneasy,

03:18.840 --> 03:21.100
just call him and ask him
to come over now.

03:21.610 --> 03:23.800
But please don't rat me out.

03:28.360 --> 03:30.210
He sent me a message this morning

03:30.520 --> 03:31.750
saying he had something to do tonight

03:31.750 --> 03:33.280
and needed to meet someone.

03:52.280 --> 03:53.720
What do you think, Xiu?

03:55.079 --> 03:55.910
About what?

03:57.120 --> 03:58.240
That girl.

04:00.320 --> 04:01.000
Nothing.

04:03.360 --> 04:04.150
I think

04:04.240 --> 04:06.500
you should just ask Xiao Zhiyu directly.

04:07.590 --> 04:08.630
It's not a big deal.

04:08.630 --> 04:10.070
It's just a family dinner.

04:10.070 --> 04:11.600
Why would I ask him about it?

04:14.430 --> 04:15.080
Fine, fine,

04:15.080 --> 04:15.750
you don't care.

04:15.750 --> 04:17.360
But can you stop causing me trouble?

04:17.360 --> 04:17.920
You mixed them up.

04:17.920 --> 04:19.380
This kind goes in this jar.

04:35.270 --> 04:37.200
Finding some peace and quiet here?

04:44.680 --> 04:45.150
Sit.

04:52.480 --> 04:53.480
Since you're already here,

04:53.480 --> 04:54.900
why don't you go up and sit for a while?

04:54.900 --> 04:56.830
My parents are waiting to meet you.

04:57.870 --> 05:00.190
I'm not used to these kinds of gatherings.

05:00.190 --> 05:02.390
Please send my regards to your parents.

05:04.820 --> 05:05.820
I came this time

05:06.070 --> 05:07.130
to say hello to you.

05:08.040 --> 05:10.170
Congratulations on your engagement.

05:38.560 --> 05:39.690
They're beautiful.

05:40.900 --> 05:42.300
Limited edition, right?

05:43.070 --> 05:43.920
I prepared the gift

05:43.920 --> 05:45.850
before you even returned to China.

05:45.890 --> 05:47.510
After all, I knew about your engagement

05:47.510 --> 05:49.110
even before your family did.

05:49.430 --> 05:50.680
I was just so excited

05:50.680 --> 05:52.880
that I couldn't help telling you first.

05:53.480 --> 05:54.270
This trip back

05:54.270 --> 05:55.430
is mainly to greet

05:55.430 --> 05:57.159
my relatives and friends here.

05:57.680 --> 05:58.280
By the way,

05:58.390 --> 06:00.410
your mom was quite shocked
when she heard about

06:00.410 --> 06:01.370
my engagement.

06:06.560 --> 06:07.890
During my school years,

06:07.920 --> 06:08.980
I rarely went home.

06:09.380 --> 06:11.510
Thank you for keeping her company
so often.

06:11.510 --> 06:12.510
Don't mention it.

06:12.870 --> 06:14.400
She took good care of me too.

06:23.800 --> 06:24.510
I'm sorry.

06:24.510 --> 06:25.360
Miss, let me handle it.

06:25.360 --> 06:25.750
I'm sorry.

06:25.750 --> 06:26.390
Let me. Let me handle it.

06:26.390 --> 06:27.160
Are you alright, miss?

06:27.160 --> 06:27.750
I'm fine.

06:32.390 --> 06:33.190
What's wrong?

06:36.070 --> 06:36.600
Nothing.

07:06.040 --> 07:07.000
What are they talking about?

07:07.000 --> 07:08.530
They're really engrossed.

07:28.000 --> 07:28.730
Hello, miss.

07:28.830 --> 07:30.380
Is there anything I can help you with?

07:30.380 --> 07:32.140
I-I don't need help. Thank you.

07:45.830 --> 07:46.480
Sorry.

07:46.480 --> 07:47.680
I'll be leaving soon.

07:54.800 --> 07:55.390
Mr. Pei.

07:55.770 --> 07:56.530
What a coincidence.

07:56.530 --> 07:57.460
You're here too.

07:59.560 --> 08:00.190
I...

08:01.940 --> 08:04.270
You're here to see Xiao Zhiyu, aren't you?

08:04.600 --> 08:05.720
It's Saturday.

08:05.980 --> 08:07.060
You're not here

08:07.220 --> 08:09.080
to discuss work with him, are you?

08:11.950 --> 08:13.070
Mr. Pei, I have some matters to attend to.

08:13.070 --> 08:14.130
I should get going.

08:30.480 --> 08:31.120
Ms. Hu!

08:34.590 --> 08:35.320
Tell me,

08:36.030 --> 08:37.360
what exactly is your relationship

08:37.360 --> 08:38.440
with Xiao Zhiyu?

08:41.700 --> 08:42.900
She's my girlfriend.

09:03.900 --> 09:04.730
You two...

09:06.700 --> 09:07.670
Girlfriend?

09:16.910 --> 09:17.510
Pei Zhen,

09:17.540 --> 09:18.490
you're late.

09:18.970 --> 09:21.430
When you get up here,
you owe us three drinks.

09:26.390 --> 09:27.920
You should go upstairs now.

09:28.280 --> 09:30.480
Your father is waiting for you up there.

09:33.370 --> 09:34.440
Enjoy your dinner.

09:34.460 --> 09:35.520
We'll be going now.

09:44.080 --> 09:44.870
Let's go up.

10:36.390 --> 10:37.720
This isn't the way home.

10:38.670 --> 10:39.240
Let's drive around for a while.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.770
It'll make you feel better.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.290
I want to go home.

10:47.600 --> 10:48.270
Pull over!

10:48.670 --> 10:49.360
Pull over.

10:49.720 --> 10:50.600
Pull over!

11:03.080 --> 11:04.810
Are you cursing me in your mind?

11:09.080 --> 11:09.480
You...

11:09.990 --> 11:11.110
Xiao Zhiyu!

11:11.630 --> 11:12.630
Put me down.

11:13.200 --> 11:14.480
P-Put me down...

11:14.870 --> 11:16.200
Put me down.

11:16.770 --> 11:17.230
What...

11:18.030 --> 11:19.090
What are you doing?

11:19.840 --> 11:20.900
Don't move around.

11:20.910 --> 11:21.570
Let's talk.

11:22.530 --> 11:23.170
Come on.

11:26.620 --> 11:27.740
That girl...

11:29.270 --> 11:31.330
is the daughter of a former neighbor.

11:34.080 --> 11:35.940
We've known each other for years.

11:37.270 --> 11:39.270
She got engaged before coming back.

11:39.460 --> 11:40.550
I came to see her this time

11:40.550 --> 11:42.550
just to give her an engagement gift.

11:48.910 --> 11:49.480
She's...

11:50.370 --> 11:51.200
engaged?

11:57.400 --> 11:58.600
Don't be mad anymore.

11:59.120 --> 12:00.120
Who says I'm mad?

12:01.520 --> 12:02.830
Then...

12:04.520 --> 12:05.980
don't be jealous anymore.

12:07.510 --> 12:08.910
Don't flatter yourself.

12:12.320 --> 12:13.240
Stop being so smug.

12:13.240 --> 12:14.200
Y-You're still smiling?

12:14.200 --> 12:15.400
I'll stop, I'll stop.

12:19.210 --> 12:19.810
Oh, right.

12:23.960 --> 12:24.960
A peace offering.

12:28.960 --> 12:30.390
Their tickets were sold out ages ago.

12:30.390 --> 12:31.520
How did you get them?

12:32.320 --> 12:33.800
I have my ways.

12:40.490 --> 12:41.380
It's...

12:43.000 --> 12:44.730
It's not that big a deal anyway.

12:46.480 --> 12:47.410
Not mad anymore?

12:48.480 --> 12:49.360
I'm alright.

12:50.910 --> 12:51.910
Then...

13:02.420 --> 13:09.050
♪ As long as we're together, we can
empathize with even the falling leaves ♪

13:09.880 --> 13:13.560
♪ The secrets in memory are ♪

13:14.110 --> 13:17.320
♪ Exchanged in our eyes
as we're being brave ♪

13:17.770 --> 13:21.810
♪ How long have we waited
to grow familiar from strangers? ♪

13:21.950 --> 13:26.030
♪ Destiny made me cross paths with you ♪

13:26.860 --> 13:29.310
♪ I hold you in my heart ♪

13:29.340 --> 13:35.620
♪ Belief itself works wonders for life ♪

13:36.180 --> 13:40.120
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

13:40.260 --> 13:43.990
♪ The motionless night began to shimmer ♪

13:44.380 --> 13:48.660
♪ The fireworks stand as our witnesses,
as if ♪

13:49.020 --> 13:52.250
♪ They're listening to our story ♪

13:52.710 --> 13:56.000
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

13:56.640 --> 14:01.930
♪ It felt as if two lonely islands
had finally ♪

14:02.700 --> 14:07.310
♪ Held hands and slipped into
the flow of time together ♪

14:08.820 --> 14:11.630
♪ I won't wander anymore ♪

14:28.420 --> 14:29.020
I'm sorry.

14:29.240 --> 14:29.630
I'm sorry.

14:29.630 --> 14:30.200
Sorry.

14:30.550 --> 14:31.120
Sorry.

14:40.150 --> 14:40.670
Mr. Pei.

14:44.510 --> 14:46.370
It's your family dinner tonight.

14:46.400 --> 14:47.800
Why did you drink so much?

14:48.750 --> 14:50.080
Why are you here?

14:54.150 --> 14:55.550
To see my dad?

15:03.040 --> 15:03.960
Come on, let me take you home first.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.030
Don't touch me!

15:06.480 --> 15:07.840
I can walk by myself.

15:15.510 --> 15:16.030
Mr. Pei!

15:38.570 --> 15:39.690
I'm not going home.

15:42.390 --> 15:43.650
Where do you want to go?

16:21.840 --> 16:22.550
Hu Xiu.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.240
Are you there?

16:38.790 --> 16:39.510
Hu Xiu.

16:44.440 --> 16:46.570
Hu Xiu, could you please open the door?

16:50.030 --> 16:50.840
Hu Xiu!

16:51.960 --> 16:52.890
Who's out there?

16:53.330 --> 16:54.730
You woke us up!

16:56.760 --> 16:57.890
Sorry to bother you.

17:03.450 --> 17:05.380
I'm just here to borrow a Band-Aid.

17:05.630 --> 17:08.030
There's a pharmacy downstairs to the left.

17:08.160 --> 17:09.220
Stop making noise.

17:25.970 --> 17:26.730
Why?

17:32.620 --> 17:34.100
Why did it have to be him?

17:57.730 --> 17:59.550
[CFO Shen Jie]

18:15.750 --> 18:16.470
The light hits it

18:16.470 --> 18:17.950
and reflects directly off something—

18:17.950 --> 18:19.990
almost like a paper-thin film.

18:20.240 --> 18:21.110
Yes, basically...

18:21.110 --> 18:23.440
I never thought a company as big as Forma

18:23.550 --> 18:24.750
would cook the books.

18:24.750 --> 18:25.110
Yeah.

18:25.110 --> 18:26.160
This hasn't been officially announced yet.

18:26.160 --> 18:28.020
Let's wait for the final verdict.

18:35.790 --> 18:36.720
Don't stress.

18:37.000 --> 18:38.260
Have something sweet.

18:39.950 --> 18:43.210
No wonder the cooperation
has been progressing so slowly.

18:45.210 --> 18:46.740
Even Mr. Xie came in person.

18:48.330 --> 18:50.660
This project won't fall through, will it?

18:57.240 --> 18:58.060
Someone reported

18:58.060 --> 19:00.400
our falsified financial reports to Lyman.

19:00.400 --> 19:01.310
According to the procedure,

19:01.310 --> 19:02.160
after verifying

19:02.160 --> 19:03.750
the authenticity of the report,

19:03.750 --> 19:05.200
they'll report it
to regulatory authorities

19:05.200 --> 19:06.330
for investigation.

19:07.830 --> 19:09.430
This is our first violation,

19:09.780 --> 19:11.060
and we've also covered

19:11.360 --> 19:12.280
some of the funding gaps.

19:12.280 --> 19:13.940
Let's wait and see how it goes.

19:14.000 --> 19:14.860
Director Shen.

19:15.630 --> 19:17.760
Not many people know about
the company's financials.

19:17.760 --> 19:18.720
Go find out

19:19.070 --> 19:20.160
who reported us.

19:20.830 --> 19:21.350
Okay,

19:21.510 --> 19:22.160
I'm on it.

19:25.960 --> 19:26.510
Mr. Pei.

19:27.440 --> 19:28.110
We just

19:28.110 --> 19:30.050
received a written notice from Lyman.

19:30.050 --> 19:33.290
They're terminating
their intended cooperation with us.

19:33.290 --> 19:35.220
Would you like to meet with Mr. Xie?

19:49.310 --> 19:50.510
No client

19:50.680 --> 19:51.700
would entrust their projects

19:51.700 --> 19:53.910
to a contractor with financial issues.

19:57.550 --> 19:58.680
What about D Studio?

19:58.960 --> 19:59.720
So far,

19:59.720 --> 20:00.310
we haven't heard

20:00.310 --> 20:02.310
any news about them being affected.

20:04.070 --> 20:05.590
Xiao Zhiyu won't find

20:05.590 --> 20:07.680
a better contractor than us.

20:08.750 --> 20:10.840
How could he agree to cut us out?

20:29.550 --> 20:30.680
Where are you going?

20:32.150 --> 20:33.050
Making a phone call.

20:33.050 --> 20:35.450
I don't want us to lose the project
because of Forma's issues.

20:35.450 --> 20:36.730
We need a backup plan.

20:44.250 --> 20:46.080
[Ceramic Company: Mr. Shen]

20:55.160 --> 20:56.720
It's been a while, Ms. Hu.

20:56.830 --> 20:57.920
Mr. Shen?

20:58.500 --> 20:59.670
W-Why are you here?

20:59.720 --> 21:00.920
Hello, Mr. Shen.

21:00.920 --> 21:01.510
Hello, Ms. Zhou.

21:01.510 --> 21:02.480
Thank you for coming all this way.

21:02.480 --> 21:03.740
It's no trouble at all.

21:03.790 --> 21:04.440
The meeting room is this way.

21:04.440 --> 21:04.960
Please.

21:05.270 --> 21:05.800
Let's go.

21:08.130 --> 21:09.530
Come on. Watch your step.

21:16.450 --> 21:17.050
Mr. Xiao.

21:18.350 --> 21:19.160
Mr. Shen, hello.

21:19.160 --> 21:19.720
Hello.

21:19.920 --> 21:21.380
This is Mr. Xie from Lyman.

21:22.000 --> 21:23.550
This is Mr. Shen from the ceramics factory

21:23.550 --> 21:24.920
I mentioned before.

21:25.720 --> 21:26.400
Welcome.

21:26.400 --> 21:27.530
Pleased to meet you.

21:28.350 --> 21:29.640
Mr. Shen's factory can supply

21:29.640 --> 21:31.000
the 3D ceramic tiles

21:31.310 --> 21:33.970
for the exterior decoration
of the Lyman Hotel.

21:34.550 --> 21:35.550
Yes, Mr. Xie.

21:35.590 --> 21:37.110
As long as this supply chain is secured,

21:37.110 --> 21:39.160
we can work with any construction firm.

21:39.160 --> 21:40.790
We absolutely won't delay
Lyman's construction schedule.

21:40.790 --> 21:41.990
Please rest assured.

21:46.160 --> 21:46.550
This is your first time

21:46.550 --> 21:47.310
at Dynamism.

21:47.310 --> 21:48.310
What do you think?

21:48.720 --> 21:49.350
Mr. Xiao,

21:50.030 --> 21:51.590
you didn't invite me here today

21:51.590 --> 21:53.680
just to tour your studio, right?

21:54.670 --> 21:56.600
I'd like to talk to you about Forma.

21:57.470 --> 21:58.270
I suspect

21:59.070 --> 22:01.200
Forma is committing financial fraud.

22:01.990 --> 22:03.050
You have evidence?

22:04.790 --> 22:07.250
I've got the full list
of Forma's suppliers.

22:07.930 --> 22:09.460
For the sake of the project,

22:10.040 --> 22:12.640
I've personally investigated
every factory.

22:12.960 --> 22:14.550
I found several companies
whose business operations

22:14.550 --> 22:16.440
don't match their production capabilities.

22:16.440 --> 22:17.750
How could a company like Forma

22:17.750 --> 22:20.000
work long-term with shell companies?

22:20.680 --> 22:22.410
The reasonable explanation is

22:22.880 --> 22:24.750
that Forma is using these companies

22:24.750 --> 22:25.930
to fabricate business transactions

22:25.930 --> 22:27.460
to falsify their accounts.

22:28.920 --> 22:30.580
I'll verify what you've said.

22:32.510 --> 22:34.480
But you were the one who proposed

22:34.480 --> 22:36.480
bringing in Forma for this project.

22:36.750 --> 22:38.000
Why this sudden betrayal

22:38.000 --> 22:39.130
of your own partner?

22:41.310 --> 22:42.200
I have no obligation

22:42.200 --> 22:43.750
to bear Forma's risks.

22:44.400 --> 22:44.920
Also...

22:48.070 --> 22:49.200
even without Forma,

22:49.340 --> 22:51.210
we can still realize our design.

22:55.420 --> 22:57.310
Let's stay in close communication.

22:57.310 --> 22:57.880
Alright.

22:58.840 --> 23:00.880
If you need any materials from us,

23:00.990 --> 23:02.320
feel free to let us know.

23:12.550 --> 23:13.160
Everyone,

23:13.750 --> 23:15.000
I assume you've all

23:15.000 --> 23:16.800
heard about Forma's situation.

23:17.480 --> 23:18.680
Please rest assured.

23:18.790 --> 23:20.550
No matter what happens with Forma,

23:20.550 --> 23:23.110
we'll still proceed with
Lyman's project as planned.

23:23.110 --> 23:23.880
Our studio

23:23.880 --> 23:25.280
won't be affected at all.

23:27.720 --> 23:29.030
That's great.

23:29.200 --> 23:30.550
H-H-Honestly,

23:30.550 --> 23:32.350
I've been on edge all day.

23:32.510 --> 23:34.510
I almost made a mistake
in my drawing just now.

23:34.510 --> 23:36.140
You just can't handle the pressure.

23:36.140 --> 23:37.400
You need to toughen up.

23:37.600 --> 23:38.460
Come on, Hu Xiu.

23:39.140 --> 23:41.720
The reason we weren't dragged down
by Forma this time

23:41.720 --> 23:42.980
is all thanks to Hu Xiu.

23:43.290 --> 23:44.000
At that time, Forma was

23:44.000 --> 23:45.690
using the supply of special materials
as leverage in negotiations,

23:45.690 --> 23:47.170
but Hu Xiu didn't give up.

23:47.640 --> 23:48.550
She finally found

23:48.550 --> 23:49.950
a very reliable factory.

23:50.240 --> 23:52.230
That's why we weren't put in
a passive position

23:52.230 --> 23:55.230
and could ensure
the design plan proceeded smoothly.

23:58.950 --> 24:01.200
Hu Xiu, you've made a great contribution!

24:01.200 --> 24:01.790
Hu Xiu,

24:01.920 --> 24:02.830
if I were you,

24:02.960 --> 24:04.640
I'd definitely take this opportunity

24:04.640 --> 24:06.070
to ask Mr. Xiao and Ms. Zhou for

24:06.070 --> 24:08.200
some tangible rewards, don't you think?

24:08.200 --> 24:09.000
That's right.

24:09.740 --> 24:11.590
-More bonus!
-More bonus!

24:11.750 --> 24:13.550
-More bonus!
-More bonus!

24:13.580 --> 24:14.650
-More bonus!
-More bonus!

24:14.650 --> 24:15.450
More bonus...

24:23.790 --> 24:25.440
Bonuses are great, of course,  right?

24:25.440 --> 24:26.920
But before we talk about more bonuses,

24:26.920 --> 24:28.200
we still need to work hard!

24:28.200 --> 24:30.750
However, having a dinner gathering first
shouldn't be a problem, right?

24:30.750 --> 24:31.920
How about we go for hot pot?

24:31.920 --> 24:32.720
Sounds good?

24:33.000 --> 24:35.070
Having a group dinner first
is fine, right?

24:35.070 --> 24:36.110
Our hero,

24:36.110 --> 24:38.000
let's go to the concert tonight.

24:39.510 --> 24:41.200
Hot pot? Hot pot sounds good as well.

24:41.200 --> 24:42.920
The hot pot place we went to last time
was really good.

24:42.920 --> 24:43.590
What else do you want?

24:43.590 --> 24:44.880
Just say whatever else you want.

24:44.880 --> 24:46.830
Trip! Let's go on a trip!

25:09.830 --> 25:10.290
Come on.

25:18.310 --> 25:19.110
What's wrong?

25:19.110 --> 25:20.910
You've been quiet the whole way.

25:25.960 --> 25:26.510
Tell me.

25:28.590 --> 25:29.310
How did you manage to

25:29.310 --> 25:31.480
get in touch with Mr. Shen so quickly?

25:34.820 --> 25:36.650
My girlfriend worked hard
to find that supplier,

25:36.650 --> 25:38.450
so of course I took it seriously.

25:39.550 --> 25:41.810
I've kept that file you gave me all along.

25:43.440 --> 25:45.970
You'd already reached out to him,
hadn't you?

25:46.240 --> 25:48.100
Back around the Spring Festival.

25:48.200 --> 25:49.200
Spring Festival?

25:51.000 --> 25:52.440
Wasn't that right after you announced

25:52.440 --> 25:54.040
the partnership with Forma?

25:55.920 --> 25:59.250
You already thought
Forma would have problems at that time?

25:59.440 --> 26:00.680
Of course not.

26:01.240 --> 26:02.160
I just don't like

26:02.160 --> 26:04.020
the feeling of having no options.

26:04.200 --> 26:05.480
"Always have a backup plan

26:05.480 --> 26:06.750
and always fix your weaknesses.

26:06.750 --> 26:08.350
That way, you won't be constrained."

26:08.350 --> 26:08.830
See?

26:09.000 --> 26:10.530
It came in handy, didn't it?

26:12.160 --> 26:12.760
Of course.

26:13.510 --> 26:14.310
Thanks to you.

26:17.400 --> 26:19.060
I really can't figure you out.

26:19.880 --> 26:21.820
You planned everything so carefully,

26:21.820 --> 26:22.820
like

26:22.850 --> 26:25.980
you never intended to work with Forma
in the first place.

26:29.150 --> 26:30.280
Don't overthink it.

26:31.240 --> 26:32.150
Let's enjoy the concert first.

26:32.150 --> 26:33.280
It's about to start.

26:33.680 --> 26:35.030
In the future, if you make any decisions,

26:35.030 --> 26:36.890
can you at least give me a heads-up?

26:36.890 --> 26:38.570
You had me on edge.

26:39.310 --> 26:41.350
You know, when Mr. Shen came today,

26:41.350 --> 26:43.200
I was literally calling him.

26:43.200 --> 26:44.660
And then he just showed up.

27:36.910 --> 27:41.940
♪ I saw the tram
driving under the sunset ♪

27:44.760 --> 27:49.520
♪ Like walking into a pause in a summer ♪

27:51.380 --> 27:54.350
♪ At this moment, the sunset is gentle ♪

27:55.130 --> 27:58.240
♪ I look up and press the shutter ♪

27:59.120 --> 28:06.340
♪ I take a piece of cloud
from your city as a memory ♪

28:07.290 --> 28:12.130
♪ Looking at the people
in skyscrapers leaving work ♪

28:14.450 --> 28:19.600
♪ Leaving a hurried silhouette
for the dusk ♪

28:21.330 --> 28:24.430
♪ Talking about random topics ♪

28:25.100 --> 28:28.360
♪ Waiting for the traffic light at dusk ♪

28:29.050 --> 28:35.870
♪ To the left or to the right,
not about eternity ♪

28:36.450 --> 28:38.450
♪ I'm missing you so much ♪

28:38.540 --> 28:42.860
♪ And wondering what kind of life
you're living right now ♪

28:43.680 --> 28:48.740
♪ I can only hear about your recent life
through gossip ♪

28:50.470 --> 28:57.450
♪ We pass by one another
in the bustling streets ♪

28:57.780 --> 29:03.170
♪ Life is pushing us
into the paths yet unknown ♪

28:59.480 --> 29:00.270
So...

29:01.550 --> 29:03.590
you won't push me away anymore?

29:04.460 --> 29:05.790
No matter what happens,

29:06.680 --> 29:08.270
we'll face it together.

29:09.920 --> 29:12.350
And I will always hold your hand tight.

29:14.480 --> 29:16.550
I don't know what your wish is,

29:17.600 --> 29:20.330
but I hope more than anyone else
that you can fulfill it.

29:20.330 --> 29:24.830
♪ That brief kiss I dreamed of
last night ♪

29:21.160 --> 29:22.440
When you have time,

29:22.790 --> 29:24.550
tell me about your father.

29:25.830 --> 29:27.030
But I'm not in a hurry.

29:27.140 --> 29:32.470
♪ Like a little gift
that comes from time to time ♪

29:27.720 --> 29:29.520
Whenever you feel like talking,

29:30.190 --> 29:30.920
I'll be here.

29:34.150 --> 29:36.970
♪ Whenever a familiar silhouette appears
in the crowd ♪

29:37.720 --> 29:40.500
♪ I pause, lost in thought ♪

29:39.790 --> 29:41.390
What are you thinking about?

29:41.830 --> 29:48.500
♪ Hoping to grasp something
once familiar ♪

29:43.200 --> 29:44.260
After the concert,

29:44.680 --> 29:46.280
I have something to tell you.

29:46.880 --> 29:47.590
What did you say?

29:47.590 --> 29:48.590
I didn't hear you!

29:49.130 --> 29:51.130
♪ I'm missing you so much ♪

29:51.160 --> 29:55.660
♪ And wondering what kind of life
you're living right now ♪

29:56.350 --> 30:02.010
♪ I can only hear about your recent life
through gossip ♪

30:03.200 --> 30:10.150
♪ We pass by one another
in the bustling streets ♪

30:10.460 --> 30:15.870
♪ Life is pushing us
into the paths yet unknown ♪

30:17.860 --> 30:19.860
♪ The days feel endless ♪

30:20.550 --> 30:25.750
♪ Yet I still want to wait for you ♪

30:22.920 --> 30:24.440
I don't want to soak anymore.

30:24.440 --> 30:25.590
What are you doing?

30:26.110 --> 30:27.640
Our daughter bought the herb packs
for you.

30:27.640 --> 30:28.790
Soaking in it is good for your leg.

30:28.790 --> 30:30.000
Soak a little longer.

30:30.510 --> 30:31.590
Just a bit longer.

30:31.750 --> 30:32.150
You...

30:32.750 --> 30:34.350
She's always wasting money.

30:35.790 --> 30:37.390
You can pretend all you want,

30:37.680 --> 30:39.940
but inside, you're happier than anyone.

30:43.830 --> 30:44.550
Who is it?

30:46.480 --> 30:46.960
It's so late.

30:46.960 --> 30:48.110
Could it be Xiu?

30:50.200 --> 30:50.920
Coming!

30:55.040 --> 30:55.770
Who's there?

31:12.920 --> 31:13.590
Who is it?

31:15.160 --> 31:16.560
There's nobody outside.

31:16.870 --> 31:18.240
Just this envelope left outside.

31:18.240 --> 31:18.920
A delivery?

31:19.590 --> 31:20.920
But there's no delivery info on it.

31:20.920 --> 31:21.480
Look.

31:48.200 --> 31:49.000
Isn't this...

32:13.490 --> 32:15.580
My dad called me several times.

32:15.680 --> 32:16.640
I'm worried something urgent
might have come up.

32:16.640 --> 32:17.510
I'll go outside to take the call.

32:17.510 --> 32:18.000
Okay.

32:31.110 --> 32:33.510
Now, for the moment
everyone's been waiting for.

32:33.510 --> 32:35.270
The band train is about to depart!

32:35.270 --> 32:36.720
Where's the leader?

32:36.860 --> 32:37.990
-Right here.
-Here!

32:44.060 --> 32:44.830
Hu Xiu!

32:57.940 --> 33:01.570
♪ Midnight ♪

33:02.580 --> 33:07.640
♪ I see stars fly ♪

33:09.470 --> 33:14.820
♪ As they fall to Earth ♪

33:12.300 --> 33:14.410
[Architect Xiao Zhiyu's
true identity revealed.]

33:14.410 --> 33:16.530
[His biological father, Qin Yuze, was
behind a major construction accident...]

33:15.420 --> 33:22.820
♪ Lighting up this moment ♪

33:23.500 --> 33:25.820
♪ You outshine the stars ♪

33:26.340 --> 33:29.070
♪ And hold them in your palm ♪

33:29.510 --> 33:32.540
♪ Now we've made a way ♪

33:33.150 --> 33:36.570
♪ Now we're at the edge ♪

33:36.590 --> 33:38.590
♪ Tomorrow and today ♪

33:39.610 --> 33:42.220
♪ Now in every way ♪

33:42.250 --> 33:47.340
♪ The world draws still ♪

33:47.770 --> 33:52.170
♪ I wish for you ♪

33:53.950 --> 33:59.480
♪ I wish for you ♪

34:00.190 --> 34:06.490
♪ Look up at the moon
and reach for my hand ♪

34:06.520 --> 34:10.310
♪ Oh I wish for you ♪

34:28.620 --> 34:29.179
Hu Xiu.

34:31.550 --> 34:32.230
Let's talk.

34:37.230 --> 34:39.230
Is what they're saying online true?

34:48.230 --> 34:49.110
Where are you going?

34:49.110 --> 34:49.880
Home.

34:50.340 --> 34:50.960
You're going home to stay?

34:50.960 --> 34:52.020
I'll take you back.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.030
I'm sorry.

34:59.030 --> 35:00.960
I-I didn't mean to hide it from you.

35:01.320 --> 35:03.650
I was just waiting for the right moment...

35:17.830 --> 35:19.030
You said it yourself.

35:19.800 --> 35:20.480
You said...

35:21.070 --> 35:23.330
you'd be there whenever I wanted to talk.

35:39.720 --> 35:40.380
Mom, you...

35:40.400 --> 35:41.070
Calm down.

35:41.070 --> 35:42.600
I'm coming to you right now.

35:46.430 --> 35:47.460
What happened?

35:49.340 --> 35:51.170
My dad was hit by a car...

35:52.460 --> 35:53.230
I'll take you there.

35:53.230 --> 35:54.160
It'll be faster.

36:06.040 --> 36:06.600
Mom.

36:08.070 --> 36:08.680
Xiu.

36:09.920 --> 36:10.960
The ambulance brought him in.

36:10.960 --> 36:11.710
He's inside.

36:12.000 --> 36:13.270
The doctor says they need to

36:13.270 --> 36:14.500
check his condition.

36:15.360 --> 36:17.220
What about the person who hit Dad?

36:18.020 --> 36:19.280
The police are handling it.

36:19.280 --> 36:21.510
They're detaining him at the scene
to investigate.

36:21.510 --> 36:23.110
He's also the one
who called the ambulance.

36:23.110 --> 36:23.670
Mom, Mom.

36:23.670 --> 36:24.510
Mom, calm down.

36:24.510 --> 36:25.480
I'm here now.

36:25.480 --> 36:27.410
I'll handle everything from here.

36:31.190 --> 36:32.190
Family of Hu Ding?

36:32.190 --> 36:32.630
Here!

36:32.630 --> 36:33.190
We're here.

36:33.190 --> 36:34.590
Doctor, how is my father?

36:34.670 --> 36:36.140
His leg is injured. It's fractured.

36:36.140 --> 36:38.350
Fortunately, there's no
internal organ rupture

36:38.350 --> 36:39.880
or intracranial bleeding.

36:40.030 --> 36:40.760
We'll transfer him from the ER to surgery.

36:40.760 --> 36:42.270
The operation can be performed tonight.

36:42.270 --> 36:44.730
Please go handle the admission procedures.

36:44.960 --> 36:46.190
Why his leg again...

36:46.320 --> 36:46.960
Doctor,

36:46.960 --> 36:49.320
will his previous condition worsen
after the surgery?

36:49.320 --> 36:51.710
You'll have to ask the surgeon
about that, okay?

36:51.710 --> 36:52.310
Thank you.

36:53.810 --> 36:54.330
Mom.

36:54.670 --> 36:55.550
Don't panic.

36:55.630 --> 36:58.480
Let's follow the doctor's advice
and have Dad undergo the surgery first.

36:58.480 --> 36:59.920
Give me Dad's ID.

36:59.920 --> 37:01.450
I'll handle the paperwork.

37:12.260 --> 37:14.060
Hospital admission for Hu Ding.

37:14.320 --> 37:16.310
Please show
the patient's health insurance card.

37:16.310 --> 37:17.950
Is the digital version okay?
I have it on my phone.

37:17.950 --> 37:18.620
Scan here.

37:38.710 --> 37:39.770
I'll take care of this.

37:39.770 --> 37:41.230
Go accompany your mother.

37:46.210 --> 37:47.670
Do you need anything else?

38:15.030 --> 38:16.400
How did it go, doctor?

38:18.920 --> 38:20.190
The surgery went well.

38:20.360 --> 38:22.560
All external wounds have been sutured.

38:23.040 --> 38:24.040
Nothing serious.

38:25.190 --> 38:26.360
After the patient wakes up,

38:26.360 --> 38:28.290
we'll conduct a full examination.

38:28.550 --> 38:29.030
Doctor...

38:29.030 --> 38:29.630
Thank you.

38:29.840 --> 38:31.760
Will my father have trouble walking?

38:31.760 --> 38:33.070
He's previously had a leg injury

38:33.070 --> 38:34.930
and has undergone surgery twice.

38:35.060 --> 38:37.140
It depends on his recovery.

38:37.250 --> 38:38.910
If rehabilitation goes well,

38:39.320 --> 38:41.250
he should be able to walk just fine.

38:41.400 --> 38:42.880
Thank you for your hard work.

38:42.880 --> 38:43.480
Thank you.

38:43.480 --> 38:44.810
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

38:45.550 --> 38:46.190
Thank you.

38:56.720 --> 38:57.730
[Name Changed, Legacy Inherited: Architect
Xiao Zhiyu's true identity revealed.]

38:57.730 --> 38:58.750
[His biological father, Qin Yuze,
was behind a major construction accident.]

39:24.840 --> 39:25.400
Dad.

39:32.470 --> 39:34.510
I've received a notice
from the audit committee.

39:34.510 --> 39:36.140
They're launching
an internal investigation first

39:36.140 --> 39:38.470
and will coordinate with the regulators.

39:38.940 --> 39:40.550
Verifying the authenticity of the report

39:40.550 --> 39:42.190
will take about a month.

39:42.440 --> 39:44.370
That gives us some breathing room.

39:46.910 --> 39:48.710
Who's behind this?

39:48.760 --> 39:49.840
Any leads?

39:51.800 --> 39:52.930
Could it be Shen Jie?

39:55.840 --> 39:57.500
When financial issues arise,

39:57.550 --> 39:59.950
he is usually the first
to be investigated.

40:01.280 --> 40:02.810
He wouldn't be that stupid.

40:04.420 --> 40:05.900
Then what did you find out?

40:07.510 --> 40:09.030
I did uncover something.

40:10.110 --> 40:11.570
The person who reported us

40:11.990 --> 40:13.320
is one of our suppliers.

40:20.320 --> 40:21.650
You can't trust rumors.

40:22.090 --> 40:24.150
You need to investigate personally.

40:27.920 --> 40:29.850
I'm afraid it won't be that simple.

40:30.310 --> 40:32.510
You've managed Forma for so many years.

40:32.800 --> 40:34.320
I don't know

40:35.260 --> 40:36.790
who your trusted people are

40:37.280 --> 40:38.670
or which partners

40:39.290 --> 40:40.480
you've been wary of.

40:41.030 --> 40:42.560
I don't know where to start.

40:45.180 --> 40:46.460
I still know

40:47.300 --> 40:48.500
too little about you.

40:49.800 --> 40:50.630
Get some rest.

40:52.710 --> 40:54.030
It was you who leaked

40:54.370 --> 40:56.300
Xiao Zhiyu's identity, wasn't it?

41:01.400 --> 41:02.730
You couldn't stand him.

41:04.190 --> 41:06.850
But you kept this secret for him
all these years.

41:07.720 --> 41:09.150
Why did you act on your own

41:09.670 --> 41:10.780
and choose this particular moment

41:10.780 --> 41:11.510
to expose it?

41:23.760 --> 41:25.110
I had to...

41:27.840 --> 41:29.030
keep at least one thing for myself.
